<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Aug 06.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Aug 06.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to STAG Oct/Dec 112.00/13.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Oct/Dec 115.00/16.00 Jan/Mar 118.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk this week 85.00/83.50/84.00 next week 84.00/83.50</p>
<p>BBNO next week 84.00/83.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire next week 87.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jan/Mar 91.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Sep 82.50/83.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 88.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk asa 74.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk this week 74.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire asa 93.00</p>
<p>Avon range asa 75.50</p>
